/**
 * Issue #4450 — the manual-route cutover: the manual delivery builders
 * (PDF/XLSX/CSV) rebuild in workflow residency from env + the stored
 * request + the artifact-store adapter, so the manual shape's eight
 * stages execute through the host with shapeReport/deliver no longer
 * refusing. No ScreenerAgent handle exists in the residency: XLSX/CSV
 * are generated by the pure generators and written through the blob
 * store, which is what makes them servable through the established
 * endpoints (the direct-R2 fallback in getReportPdf, on a pointer
 * miss in the serving store).
 *
 * The route dispatches through the host only when three gates hold:
 * the resolved broker is the residency's bound broker (#3960 owns
 * carrying broker+mode as a stage input), the filter carries explicit
 * underlyingSymbols (#4473 owns universe deps as a stage input), and
 * the workflow residency bindings are configured. Anything else keeps
 * the unchanged sync dispatch — no behaviour regression.
 *
 * These tests prove the residency delivery factory (generated keys +
 * servability through an empty serving store, the unbound-blob-store
 * named failure, the env-absent invocation refusal, deferDelivery),
 * the route gate, the shared response body, the env-backed run deps
 * helper, and a manual-shape run completing all eight stages through
 * the host with the report artifact readable from the durable store.
 */
